            <div xml:id="m-14badc5d-73e5-4beb-8888-a15845ebf5e5">
              <lg xml:id="m-42f30884-5ec5-487b-92aa-86fc564b2459">
                <l xml:id="m-f9081bc9-e5e7-46b6-9582-8f33fea75fd8" facs="#m-1cfc4c55-3a4a-47b9-a3cb-25222743fb35" label="text-like">The Tones of the Psalms.</l><l xml:id="m-16a030f3-b0d1-416a-b26d-f0f14bfa8bcf" facs="#m-e82c4a33-b402-42b6-830c-12d8a53bb1b8" label="ambiguous">ua</l><l xml:id="m-0f008630-8d8b-4e2b-9593-92e6251c41ab" facs="#m-053e7c95-36ca-4edb-b77c-07adaae52d89" label="ambiguous">Eighth Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-6ece92c8-88d6-4eb2-93d2-85358ac217c6" facs="#m-21d88cbf-0075-4ee5-90ac-c9c4c1c41a73" label="ambiguous">Terminations.</l><l xml:id="m-86a9dfb2-15ae-4858-97a6-174e790e2e3d" facs="#m-64ff8f98-c412-4c66-93b0-4ec8b165c083" label="text-like">Mediant of i accent.</l><l xml:id="m-ba929138-50d7-441c-8961-6b0243f832ed" facs="#m-01117354-bff1-4542-8d99-6aafd95e99ca" label="text-like">Terminations of r accent</l><l xml:id="m-2cfcf5c3-4147-4517-ade5-a4734f0fef5e" facs="#m-389cc91b-681f-4f3c-b774-35fbcedd42c1" label="ambiguous">vitha preparatory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-ad8834a6-7830-4620-9177-0cf03a97afdf" facs="#m-1ca3759f-a68f-407f-84d4-607401b2f1d5" label="ambiguous">Int.</l><l xml:id="m-75d2d985-744d-41cb-92df-d841161a137c" facs="#m-88c2baf4-32c3-42c9-a526-0f08bdafb4b0" label="text-like">Tenor and Flex</l><l xml:id="m-7ebd0b0a-ad09-423d-9aeb-8992bff4b9bc" facs="#m-944c1068-68e3-4c35-84d8-d84e86e2a6ea" label="ambiguous">Mediant Tenor</l><l xml:id="m-621c22df-2a06-4f75-af1f-ecbe2223fde9" facs="#m-68697ce1-c981-4ed2-8cd1-df00c55a2b40" label="text-like">The «Peregrinus» Tone."</l><l xml:id="m-a338acf9-2002-44dd-874a-6d97f3c9bcbe" facs="#m-dc630835-6761-4711-99df-7beb0fef57dc" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent vith : preparatory</l><l xml:id="m-c4add041-a46c-4356-a170-62b3eee85b21" facs="#m-fc9d571b-4a9d-44a4-958a-ceed8b38f4fe" label="ambiguous">Termination of:accent vith 1 pre¬</l><l xml:id="m-9027978a-74fe-4918-909b-c2cfeffab5c5" facs="#m-3ddf3048-ddf4-49ab-bf6f-55bb5e62fdbe" label="ambiguous">paratory syllable.</l><l xml:id="m-78ae54b5-fea9-4f4c-8492-940ddc49dce2" facs="#m-c0532696-cf25-427b-9033-b83fa2eb7ad3" label="ambiguous">syllable=— e= vithz preparatory syllable¬</l><l xml:id="m-170e8fa9-0f3a-48b0-af24-2e8df8f68739" facs="#m-0db5c461-ab18-4b8a-b1e4-5c741fe69d4e" label="text-like">Int. Tenor and Flex</l><l xml:id="m-e9f16c31-f282-463b-b96d-267fe31fa0a2" facs="#m-35237e22-a3b5-4656-a0b4-34ca76874da8" label="ambiguous">Tenor Sole ending.</l><l xml:id="m-e9c349a9-6b09-4c23-ae83-b148dd3d6343" facs="#m-ce27cf99-1190-42ce-b3ed-3462b2e8f952" label="ambiguous">Mediant</l><l xml:id="m-7bd790a5-f277-4d34-86f8-bfc2499adc4f" facs="#m-af4a0d17-ba86-4464-a84d-873d09c9f13d" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-25e93c5a-0f2f-43b5-a1b6-1e2e6b1a47b7" facs="#m-9dbc10f9-ed95-4735-9dc6-ac474fe9b9e3" label="ambiguous">Another formula.</l><l xml:id="m-4a4affb0-fba6-4c29-ab56-914ce04ba7bb" facs="#m-0549857e-e081-488d-805d-d106710f8cf1" label="ambiguous">Int.</l><l xml:id="m-f9ca3853-ac66-4d00-b40a-d3a2f2490a0d" facs="#m-743361e9-a4d5-4288-8e5b-beeecc258764" label="text-like">"In accordance with the authorisation granted by Rome, a sol may be added</l><l xml:id="m-9ad1a5b9-2161-4e58-9719-09d12e9347c2" facs="#m-15ef826d-e867-402a-9cc4-cfcd5984ae45" label="text-like">a tibitum before the si at the mediant of the Peregrinus tone. Owing to this slight</l><l xml:id="m-08f63435-fda0-4b06-9857-c3f219a6ee2b" facs="#m-01a149f5-3c40-45fa-a46a-7853d36887ff" label="text-like">change, this formula becomes regular and is of r accent with 3 preparatory syllables.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
